// The two rings in Zanaris that are one-way exits (OSRS wiki, Fairy ring (Zanaris)): by the
// Chicken Shrine to the shed in the Lumbridge Swamp, and in the marketplace to Al Kharid, behind
// the bank (Void, FairyAttendant.kt: 3260,3171). EASCape: both are the 2007 cache's rings now
// (area_fairy_rings), with the fairy ring's flowers.
[oploc1,ft2_fairy_ring_12094] ~zanaris_exit_ring(0_50_49_1_33);
[oploc1,ft2_fairy_ring_12003] ~zanaris_exit_ring(0_50_49_60_35);

[proc,zanaris_exit_ring](coord $dest)
~fairy_rings_travel(loc_coord, $dest);
